# ── RH-LENSES-a: the remote-group catalog (card 74e02a05) ─────────────────
#
# A DIRECTORY GROUP REFERENCE is an external group value this board has SEEN at
# an Identity provider -- from an OIDC login claim, from a SCIM push, or both.
# It holds no authority and reaches nobody until an administrator BINDS it to a
# Group, which is what `use` does.
#
# WHAT YOU SEE DEPENDS ON HOW YOU SIGNED IN, and that is deliberate. The catalog
# is deployment-shaped disclosure -- every external group name in the estate and
# how many people carry each -- so in v1 it is answered in full only to a ROOT
# LOGIN SESSION. A bearer credential, which is what this CLI presents, receives
# `200` and an EMPTY LIST rather than a refusal: an empty list says "nothing
# here for you", where a 403 would say "there is a populated surface here".


